CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --replace-call-with-contract my_log
^\[my_log\.precondition\.1\] line 5 Check requires clause of contract contract::my_log for function my_log: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line 14 contract replaced: SUCCESS$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
The harness has to pass the write set where the replacement wrapper of the
variadic function my_log has its write set parameter.
